From 61712ef81a125a22e54fe6e6783de37c906f7793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:09:23 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] kcm_proxy: clearer wording and section titles; same
 one-page form

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md section 1). It is already one Kirigami.Form with the five proxy-type radios first
and the details of the chosen type below, so the structure stays; settings, kcfg, wpad-detector and env lookups are
unchanged. The details of the other types stay hidden (they only apply to the selected type; page-design section 3
allows hiding what cannot apply), not disabled.

Renamed (inventory/relabel/kcm_proxy.tsv):
- "Use manually-specified proxy configuration" -> "Use manual proxy configuration" (kcm_proxy/ProxyType).
- "Url:" -> "Address:" in the four manual blocks (HTTP, SSL, FTP, SOCKS); block titles are bold and sentence case
  ("HTTP proxy").
- ksr: markers on every text-only control (Choose file, Auto-Detect, Show env values, all protocols, restart notice).

Speed (cause from code, not measured):
- kcm.autoDetectResolve (environment lookup) only runs when system mode is selected (Component.onCompleted guard in
  SystemProxyConfiguration): unchanged and cheap. The ~30 hidden FormEntry items of the system and manual blocks
  (main.qml) are still instantiated up front; putting them behind a Loader inside Kirigami.Form could not be checked
  without a build, so it is left for the manager's measurement.
- Numbers: before ~1.6 s under load (ranking only). After: pending, manager will measure.
- Left alone: kcm_proxy.json keywords include "Firewall" (misleading; belongs to kcm_firewall), a translated search
  keyword list that needs a decision.

HIG: HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-019.

Not built yet (freeze).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
